From: Wren <wren@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] upstream: carry webkitglib/2.54 queue after 2.54.3 (c01fbd906..9715f4680)

Upstream has not cut a wpewebkit-2.54.4.tar.xz release tarball yet, so the
Buildroot recipe stays on wpewebkit-2.54.3.tar.xz and carries the 21 commits
queued on origin/webkitglib/2.54 (c01fbd906b1f..9715f4680a3e, 2026-11-17 to
2026-11-21) filtered to the 58 Source/ files present in the WPE tarball
(excluding GTK-only files and LayoutTests/TestWebKitAPI not shipped in the
tarball). Key fixes included: SharedWorker top-origin validation (b/323227),
JSON module MIME-type security check (b/322522), CSP embed/object redirect
checks (b/311521), WebFrameProxy/WebProcessProxy fixes (b/328933), accelerated
opacity transition in RenderLayer (b/329736), WebGL context creation error
re-entrancy (b/324896), WritableStreamSink/TransformStream fixes (b/320102,
b/323097, b/323098), GLFenceEGL/GLFenceGL already-signaled fast path (b/332147),
WPEWebViewPlatform gamepad focus lookup (b/330905), RemoteInspectorClient
assertion removal (b/331126), and WebKitWebContext automation-session detach on
dispose (b/332446). Drop this patch when moving the series to an official
wpewebkit-2.54.4.tar.xz release.
---
